        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kituruworoe Yob ŋolo iapara ka ŋolo eyakar ŋuna acamit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku aŋun, toboŋok Yob Ekapolon tema,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kisirumae ŋikonei a Yob ŋileec",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedau Ekapolon akirwor ŋakiro ŋun neni a Yob, tema Ekapolon neni a Elipas a Etemanait, “Anyunyura ayoŋ neni kon ka neni a ŋikonei kon Bilidad ka Sopar, anerae nyirworo iyes aŋuna kaŋ ŋuna iyookino, lopite ŋolo erworitor Yob eketiyan kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, tolemutu tokona ŋimoŋin ŋikanikaarei ka ŋimeesekin ŋikanikaarei, ido toloto neni a Yob a eketiyan kaŋ, iinakis erae amuronot ŋina epeyo aŋuna kus. Ikilipakini iyes Yob eketiyan kaŋ, acamuni ayoŋ akilip keŋ ŋina akadyekitor iŋes ayoŋ nyetiya neni kus ikwa emaikina aŋuna ka abaŋao kus; anerae ipotu iyes nyirworo ŋuna iyookino aŋuna kaŋ lopite ŋolo erworitor Yob eketiyan kaŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu Elipas ŋolo arae Etemanait kaapei ka Bilidad ŋolo arae Esuit ta Sopar ŋolo arae Enaamasit toloto kitiyata ŋuna alimokini Ekapolon ikes, ido abu Ekapolon tocamu akilip a Yob.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inak nabo Akuj Yob ŋiboro ŋulu eyatakinitae a ŋolokimar etiyae ŋolo sek a ekiŋaren",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedau Ekapolon akiirar akilip a Yob aŋuna a ŋikonei keŋ, abu kinyakak Yob ŋiboro ŋulu sek ayakar, kiyatak a ŋolo kimar etiyae ŋolo sek a ekiŋaren. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku, potu neni a Yob ŋikaitotoi keŋ, ŋakaitotoi keŋ ka daadaŋ ŋulu sek ayenete iŋes, kimuja kaapei ka iŋes alokai keŋ. Apotu kitoodiut akiyaloloŋ ŋina sek ayakatar ikes aŋuna a Yob ka apotu kisirworiut iŋes aŋuna ka aronis a daadaŋ a ŋina abu Ekapolon yau neni keŋ abu ŋinituŋanan alotooma ŋul inak Yob ŋidisiliŋa ka ekaboboot ŋolo etiyaunitae a egolid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Ekapolon kiterereŋ Yob alorwa keŋ a ŋulu esidyok akilo ŋulu a ekiŋaren; abu Yob toyakaunor ŋamesekin ŋalipyo ŋatomon ka ŋaomwon, ŋikaala ŋalipyo ŋakanikapei, ŋimoŋin ŋalipyo ŋaarei ka ŋisigirya aliput. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ iŋes toyakaunor ŋidwe ŋulusapa ŋikanikaarei ka ŋulupesur ŋiuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes tolimok ekiro anakoku keŋ a ŋina esyaunan Yemima, ekiro a ŋina a ŋaarei Kesia ka ŋina a ŋauni arae ekiro keŋ Kerenapuc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anakwap a ŋin a daadaŋ, amam ŋaberu ŋuna ebusak ikwa ŋidwe a Yob ŋulupesur, ido abu papa kec inak ikes ŋiboro ŋulu apotu toruworos ŋulu kec lopite ŋolo aryamunitotor ŋikaitotoi kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a ŋun, abu Yob toyar todol ŋikaru keŋ amiat ka ŋatomoniomwon, abu kiŋolik ŋidwe keŋ ka ŋapapae keŋ todolo ŋanyameta ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Yob totwan emojoŋit nooi, ikoŋikoŋit ŋikaru ŋulu alalak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
